C51 COMPILER V9.60.0.0   VL53L0X_API                                                       09/19/2025 16:16:51 PAGE 39  

2340   3                      }
2341   2                      break;
2342   2              case VL53L0X_DEVICEMODE_CONTINUOUS_TIMED_RANGING:
